%% Sequence — room request and approval
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Rq as CR / Teacher
  participant UI as Web app
  participant API as API server
  participant DB as Database
  actor Ad as Dept admin
  participant N as Notifications / email
  participant Job as Scheduler

  Rq->>UI: Free-room view (date, slot)
  UI->>API: GET /rooms/free?date&start&end
  API->>DB: Rooms minus routine slots, approved bookings, cancellations
  API-->>UI: Free rooms
  Rq->>UI: Request Room 311 (target, note)
  UI->>API: POST /room-requests
  API->>API: Check free, ≥ 12 h ahead, this/next week, < 3 open, target allowed
  alt Any check fails
    API-->>UI: 422 with reason
  else Passes
    API->>DB: Insert request (pending) + audit
    API-->>UI: 201 pending
  end
  Ad->>UI: Dashboard: requests grouped by room & slot
  UI->>API: POST /room-requests/{id}/approve
  API->>DB: Before cutoff (slot − 2 h)? still pending? room still free?
  API->>DB: Start transaction: status = approved (booking)
  API->>DB: Insert room_slot_lock docs (unique room + date + block)
  API->>DB: Reject other requests for room & slot
  API->>DB: Cancel requester's overlapping requests
  API->>DB: Audit log, commit (fails if any block already locked)
  API-)N: Winner approved, losers "room went to another section", target students notified
  API-->>UI: 200 — room shows Booked
  Note over Job,DB: At slot − 2 h
  Job->>DB: Pending requests past cutoff → expired
  Job-)N: Notify requesters
